              "d": "A general-purpose model supplies finished answers unless configured otherwise, so homework marks rise while understanding does not."
            },
            {
              "t": "Strugglers rely most",
              "c": [
                "Equity gap compounds"
              ],
              "d": "Pupils most likely to take shortcuts are those already struggling, compounding the equity gap caused by uneven adoption."
            },
            {
              "t": "Seen as cheating tool",
              "c": [
                "Schools restrict use"
              ],
              "d": "If the platform is seen as a cheating tool, parental support falls and schools may restrict it, losing its legitimate benefits."
            }
          ]
        },
